{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Investigate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine clues and interpret your psychic visions to find out why the Greenhouse was shut down and what happened to the groundskeeper. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/66bcf27864bb74e85d569b3c0c0e2b8e.poster.avif?t=1773293256\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/66bcf27864bb74e85d569b3c0c0e2b8e.webm?t=1773293256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/66bcf27864bb74e85d569b3c0c0e2b8e.mp4?t=1773293256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manipulate the Weather</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pick up umbrellas, beach balls or sunglasses to change the weather at will.<br>Make it rain, hail or shine to set the mood anywhere between comforting and eerie.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/b143e84150e3581956266505f1289fe7.poster.avif?t=1773293256\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/b143e84150e3581956266505f1289fe7.webm?t=1773293256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/b143e84150e3581956266505f1289fe7.mp4?t=1773293256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are lush gardens, eerie corridors and liminal spaces.<br>For each newly visited area, your character will take a photo.<br>Consult the PHOTO ALBUM from the main menu to help track which areas you are yet still to discover.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/1a121580176bce46352930b91085272b.poster.avif?t=1773293256\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/1a121580176bce46352930b91085272b.webm?t=1773293256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/1a121580176bce46352930b91085272b.mp4?t=1773293256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wander Alone or Activate Entities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a haunting walk filled with beauty and dread or enable each entity type and jump scares individually to customise your experience.<br> Fend off venomous insects with bug spray. Encounter ghosts, some may help you or attack you. If you see the Groundskeeper... run!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/ad7efff8aab615836730a30526ee2d37.poster.avif?t=1773293256\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/ad7efff8aab615836730a30526ee2d37.webm?t=1773293256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/ad7efff8aab615836730a30526ee2d37.mp4?t=1773293256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics and perspective puzzles create the path needed to move forward.<br>Some puzzles are random and change each time you play.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/542c36f29e182ad0914f183b39a99038.poster.avif?t=1773293256\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/542c36f29e182ad0914f183b39a99038.webm?t=1773293256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/542c36f29e182ad0914f183b39a99038.mp4?t=1773293256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The levels are set like an open-world with no loading in between to keep you immersed.<br>Everything is designed to feel and sound real. <br>  Foliage bends and rustles as you brush past it, water ripples and slows you down as you walk through it.      <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/bea4c6361c87e12278c8b3457fe0cb65.poster.avif?t=1773293256\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/bea4c6361c87e12278c8b3457fe0cb65.webm?t=1773293256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207210/extras/bea4c6361c87e12278c8b3457fe0cb65.mp4?t=1773293256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Weathered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3207210/098353020358be8bdd243ced053a8da0fa013a86.jpg"},{"name":"Every Corner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3207210/f84fbe2b3d39e3596af30ba87e8e599a9cb9e77f.jpg"},{"name":"In-Line","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3207210/b5e83ffb